+# GALLERY — static UI evidence
+
+The static gallery, repo demo and one-page card index collect the authorized six-card UI programme. Run `python3 reports/ui/build-gallery.py` to reproduce `reports/ui/gallery.html`, `docs/ui/demo/index.html` and `reports/ui/cards/index.html`. Images retain exact hashes in the manifest; the gallery requests no remote font, script or data and works with file://.
+
+Filters select card, viewport or screen/state. Every thumbnail opens at native resolution. Both desktop sizes retain screen/state evidence, original ART2 previews, corrected maximum-balance HUD and natural first-reward states, with clearly labelled before-repair images. The four local stage recordings cover normal and reduced motion. Samples remain labelled Sample/Unavailable and are not ownership or funded mint evidence.
+
+Guest timing ranges and motion figures are derived from the raw receipts, never entered by hand. The generator refuses absent final capture folders, blank-frame/error/write failures, reward contrast below4.5:1, missing viewport coverage and nonzero measured CLS. Original captures and earlier failed attempts remain preserved.
+
+The standalone browser contract checks both file:// entry points at both sizes, links and image hashes, six-card index, all filters, native image decoding, four playable local recordings, accessible control names, overflow, zero console errors and zero network requests. It also runs pinned SHA256-verified axe-core4.10.3 WCAG2/2.1AA rules without exclusions. Set UI_AXE_SOURCE to the already-verified audit source when running this test; no product dependency is installed. Exact-head fresh A/B grades and the draft PR are recorded on the UI ledger after this artifact is frozen.
+
+Release stays parked under SYSTEM's auth-nonce HTTP502 health hold. CXR2 is already merged/live; subsequent draft PRs must be merged in stack order only after the owner clears the hold and the user's locked release gate passes again. Superseded drafts252 and257 remain open untouched.
+
+Builder:6/6standalone browser checks PASS at both sizes, including pinned WCAG2/2.1AA checks with zero confirmed violations. The final manifest contains624captures/312paired screen-states and12fresh clean-B natural journey timings. The gallery is documentation/screenshots only; product source and tests are identical to FIRSTPLAY7d0d08e, whose once-per-head full matrix388/size is shared rather than repeated for gallery metadata. Fresh gallery gates rerun core checks, repeated product smoke, resize, strict/axe and the standalone artifact contract.
